# Analytics Strategy

## Objective

Transform raw financial data into actionable insights and behavioral intelligence.

## Analysis Types

### 1. Financial Analysis

- Revenue vs Expenses
- Profit calculation
- Monthly summaries

### 2. Behavioral Analysis

- Spending patterns
- Recurring behavior
- Impulse detection

### 3. Trend Analysis

- Growth or decline in income
- Expense trends
- Investment evolution

## KPIs

- Net Profit
- Savings Rate
- Debt Ratio
- Net Worth
- Burn Rate

## Alerts

- High debt ratio
- Low savings rate
- Increasing expenses trend
- Liquidity risk

## Processing Strategy

### Daily Jobs

- Update balances
- Detect anomalies

### Monthly Jobs

- Consolidate financial data
- Generate reports

## Output

- Insights
- Alerts
- Recommendations

## Future

- Predictive analytics
- AI-driven recommendations
